00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
In this video, I investigated the most terrifying abandoned asylum in Pakistan.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,100
um, nobody has entered this building for 30 years.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,500
When we stepped inside the main hall, the air was freezing cold.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,800
uh, you know, we noticed weird scratch marks.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,400
We noticed weird scratch marks on the operating theater door.

6
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:24,000
That was the moment our thermal camera detected a moving heat signature down the hallway.

7
